From: thisiscamk <100883750+thisiscamk@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 21:16:53 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] release: qualify compact selection against normal build
 inputs

Require verified normal cursor and Labwc components through a read-only source overlay with installed ownership. Record component replacements separately from base selections and explicit compact UI overrides.

Hide unavailable app and power launchers, restrict the bar and Home bindings to the RAM session, retain the default theme and required Qt families, and omit unneeded optional development, Tk and 3D payloads. The real normal root plan selects 293882327 bytes under the existing RAM limits; lifecycle and hardware remain unqualified.

Assisted-by: LLM
